<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Cocoon</ansi> mutation

On command, you fold inward and a hardened chrysalis shell snaps shut
around you. For a few rounds the world's blows barely reach you, and
the fight loses sight of you entirely.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Active (command: <ansi fg="command">cocoon</ansi>)
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Encases you in a near-impervious shell for a short while, and
  everything attacking you loses track of where you went

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Sealing yourself away spends your special-move readiness and your
  stamina, and costs you the moment

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
